OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment 'monitoring' district
OL,4,Acouncil, says PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has said the
OL,7,Fgovernment is "monitoring" the
OL,8,Fsituation at Ashfield District Council.
OL,10,FJason Zadrozny, former leader of the
OL,11,FNottinghamshire authority, which is run
OL,12,Fby Ashfield Independents, is awaiting
OL,13,Fsentence after being found guilty of
OL,14,Fnine counts of fraud and four counts of
OL,15,Ftax evasion last month.
OL,17,FAt Prime Minister's Questions on
OL,18,FWednesday, Ashfield's Reform UK MP Lee
OL,19,FAnderson claimed the authority was
OL,20,Fbeing "run by criminals" and asked the
OL,21,Fgovernment to send in commissioners.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
