OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment 'monitoring' district
OL,4,Acouncil, says PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as 10 Ashfield Independents
OL,7,Fcouncillors who quit the party have
OL,8,Fformed a new opposition group, the
OL,9,FDistrict Alliance.
